# The phases of TSL a player can load straight into: each line a checkpoint
# the chain keeps and its save's title, in story order. `kjk chain tsl`
# writes them as saves tsl-01, tsl-02, ... (the main checkout always, a
# worktree with --saves), loaded from the Load screen or `kjk --load tsl-03`.
# A new game is the Ebon Hawk's prologue. The "cold" ones are
# planets.route's stand-ins: the area as the story would find it, without
# the story's state before it. Method: docs/PLAYTESTS.md.
prologue_cargo        Ebon Hawk: the cargo hold
prologue_hull         Ebon Hawk: the outer hull
prologue_garage       Ebon Hawk: the garage
prologue_hyperdrive   Ebon Hawk: the hyperdrive mended
peragus_start         Peragus
peragus_morgue        Peragus: the morgue
peragus_t3            Peragus: T3-M4's part
peragus_hatch         Peragus: the mining tunnels
peragus_depot         Peragus: the fuel depot
peragus_asteroid      Peragus: the asteroid's surface
peragus_admin_again   Peragus: back to the administration level
peragus_escape        Peragus: back from the Harbinger
peragus_hangar25      Peragus: Hangar 25
peragus_escaped       Ebon Hawk: escaped from Peragus
telos_arrival         Telos: Citadel Station
telos_exchange        Telos: the Bumani Exchange
telos_planet          Telos: the Restoration Zone
telos_military_base   Telos: the old military base
telos_polar           Telos: the polar plateau
