nar_shaddaa_zez       Nar Shaddaa: Zez-Kai Ell's safe house
nar_shaddaa_done      Ebon Hawk: leaving Nar Shaddaa
dxun_jungle          Dxun: the jungle, from the landing
dxun_tests           Dxun: Mandalore's camp, the tests taken
